# 📚 Claude Code Ecosystem, Official Repos & Starters Audit

Deep dive into available Claude Code repositories and starter kits for workspace design.

---

## 🏛️ 1. Official Anthropic Repositories

- `anthropics/claude-code` (⭐ 154k): Core CLI engine, slash commands, settings schema, lifecycle hooks.
- `anthropics/skills` (⭐ 187k): Public directory for Agent Skills.
- `anthropics/claude-plugins-official` (⭐ 46k): Managed directory of high-quality plugins (`feature-dev` 7-phase workflow, `pr-review-toolkit`, `code-review`, `receipts`, `claude-md-management`, `typescript-lsp`, `pyright-lsp`).
- `anthropics/commerce-agents`: Dual agent architecture (shopping agent for customers + merchant agent for back-office) with the `commerce-builder@claude-commerce-agents` plugin (`/scaffold-commerce-agent`, `/add-commerce-flow`, `/review-commerce-agent`).
- `anthropics/claude-code-action`: GitHub Action for autonomous PR review, issue answering, and automated code implementation in CI/CD.
- `anthropics/knowledge-work-plugins`: Turn Claude into specialized roles (Product Management, Marketing, Sales, Engineering, Finance, Operations).
- `anthropics/claude-code-security-review` (⭐ 6.7k): AI-powered security review Action.
- `anthropics/sandbox-runtime` (⭐ 7k): OS-level process sandboxing without Docker containers.
- `anthropics/launch-your-agent` (⭐ 1.1k): Founder-to-live-agent skills and scoping framework.

